Package: netfogr
Type: Package
Title: R Bindings for netfog
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Tiago", "Fogolin", email = "ticofogolin@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: R bindings for the netfog graph library, built on the same
    graph_core used by the Python bindings, via extendr.
